{"unit_id":"Argonaut790__dsh-deepseek-vision#feature-tool","repo":"Argonaut790/dsh-deepseek-vision","commit":"dded52b276055faa602e8c235fe75246a5ac5840","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH DeepSeek Vision 的「按需图像分析」功能：对话模型调用 see_image，将选中的图片交给独立视觉分析器，生成摘要、OCR、逐题回答和不确定点。可选最新图片、全部图片或指定附件。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tool.ts:215-285"]}
{"unit_id":"Argonaut790__dsh-deepseek-vision#feature-evidence","repo":"Argonaut790/dsh-deepseek-vision","commit":"dded52b276055faa602e8c235fe75246a5ac5840","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH DeepSeek Vision 的「视觉证据查看」功能：每次 see_image 调用会显示结构化证据卡片，另有只读 Evidence 页面汇总会话结果，包括图片缩略图、问题答案、OCR 和不确定之处。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:117-130"]}
