{"unit_id":"Argonaut790__dsh-deepseek-vision#feature-images","repo":"Argonaut790/dsh-deepseek-vision","commit":"dded52b276055faa602e8c235fe75246a5ac5840","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH DeepSeek Vision 的「图片附件接入」功能：发送含图片的消息时，将图片上传为持久附件，并把附件引用加入文本消息，使会话中的图片可供后续视觉分析和证据展示。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/send-hook.ts:64-103"]}
